      "identification": "Page Composer Basic WordPress plugin 1.6.91 with bundled SweetAlert2 11.10.4 protestware",
      "evidence": {
        "reachability": "Assets::register hooks admin_enqueue_scripts; enqueue loads pceditor_wp_basic.js on authorized post edit screens. Bundle imports SweetAlert2 module i(6455) and initializes its dialog mixin, executing the top-level regional routine.",
        "behavior": "Russian navigator.language and host ending .ru/.su/.by/.xn--p1ai gate localStorage swal-initiation. After >3 days and a 500ms timer the code sets body.style.pointerEvents=\"none\", appends looping remote audio, then calls play after 2500ms.",
        "benign_members": "ProNotice.php renders a dismissible pricing notice and posts a nonce to local admin AJAX. Feedback.php sends user-submitted testimonial/deactivation data plus domain and versions after capability/nonce checks, with skip. ReindexPage.php checks capability/nonce and rebuilds composed post snapshots in database batches, with no time limit and continued processing after disconnect.",
        "classifier_disagreement": "Top-level ML level remains -1 (below alert threshold) and editor member level remains -1 despite explicit hostile sabotage traits. Preserve precise rules and report the miss."
