      "An arbitrary createContext member call is not Node VM use: the editor calls React createContext.",
      "Fields such as key:\"confirmButtonText\" and key:\"denyButtonColor\" do not map actions to enforcement decisions. Require a complete quoted decision value.",
      "Credential-prefixed keys and decision-valued fields are source syntax, not evidence identifying a defensive tool. Neutral observations remain, with policy exception consumers updated.",
      "wp_head and wp_body_open API references and their pair are ordinary rendering hooks, not SEO spam or droppers. Move unchanged symbol matchers and update the backlink-spam consumer."
    ],
    "severity_changes": "Complete credential field observations and WordPress hook pairs are notable instead of component; no severity reductions.",
    "ancestor_consumers": "Reviewed exact IDs and parent selectors. Do not widen tool-identity or VM-directory exclusions to include generic source fields, React context calls, or ordinary hooks. Their previous participation was unsupported.",
