  "limitations": [
    "No original deployment host/domain or successful C2 communication was observed. Browser autoplay policy may reject playback; pointer blocking is independent.",
    "Damaged UPX recovery magic prevents automatic unpacking. Original ELF findings cover family configuration and packer tampering; recovered code adds verified command execution and persistence, but YAML cannot make the engine recover that compressed code. No duplicate family-derived objective rules were added to manufacture behavioral coverage.",
    "The ZIP has one regional sabotage routine with two effects (input disabling and remote looping audio). Preserve the existing routine, bundled-delivery and family findings without inventing additional attack behaviors.",
    "Engine-emitted metadata/binary/layout/compression::upx-decompression-failed falsely describes this packed image as not packed. This description originates in cleave/src/upx.rs classify_failure, not YAML; it remains an engine reporting defect.",
    "The whole-file entropy rule remains in its explicit legacy placement hold: constraints.rs pins metadata/file/data-blob/near-maximum-entropy.yaml to its admitted archive scope."
  ],
